    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>STL-compatible allocator that obtains memory from a <ref refid="classthemis_1_1performance_1_1phase4_1_1_p_mem_pool" kindref="compound">PMemPool</ref>. Designed for use with std::vector, std::unordered_map, etc.</para>
<para>Example: <ref refid="classthemis_1_1performance_1_1phase4_1_1_p_mem_pool" kindref="compound">PMemPool</ref> pool({.path=&quot;/mnt/pmem0/themis.pool&quot;, .pool_size=1&lt;&lt;30}); std::vector&lt;int, PMemAllocator&lt;int&gt;&gt; v(PMemAllocator&lt;int&gt;(&amp;pool)); </para>
    </detaileddescription>
